From: Jonas <developer@raccoon.ing>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 10:05:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] u-boot: add sun60iw2p1-orangepi-4-pro device tree

The Allwinner A733 U-Boot defconfig (sun60iw2p1_a733_defconfig) selects the
sun60iw2p1-orangepi-4-pro device tree, which is not part of the
v2018.05-sun60iw2 U-Boot source tree.  Provide it as a thin wrapper around
the sun60iw2p1-soc-system device tree so the A733 defconfig can be used.

Signed-off-by: Jonas <developer@raccoon.ing>

diff --git a/u-boot/v2018.05-sun60iw2/arch/arm/dts/sun60iw2p1-orangepi-4-pro.dts b/u-boot/v2018.05-sun60iw2/arch/arm/dts/sun60iw2p1-orangepi-4-pro.dts
new file mode 100644
--- /dev/null
+++ b/u-boot/v2018.05-sun60iw2/arch/arm/dts/sun60iw2p1-orangepi-4-pro.dts
@@ -0,0 +1 @@
+#include "sun60iw2p1-soc-system.dts"
